    <briefdescription>
<para>Objects declared inside an inspection tool in QML. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Every object that has the tool&apos;s property receives the tool. Items among them that are children of the plot&apos;s overlay are kept stacked in declaration order above its other children. </para>
